{"qid": "mt_00039_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "neverrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e1", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0039", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 13.3, "n_tokens": 80, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "none", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.12, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 139, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.12", "answer": "对于工伤认定，根据《工伤保险条例》，职工因工作原因受到事故伤害或者患职业病的，应当被认定为工伤。具体到您的情况，如果员工在工作中受伤并符合工伤认定标准，那么工伤认定程序会启动。\n\n关于工伤认定所需材料，通常包括但不限于：\n\n1. 工伤认定申请表；\n2. 与用人单位存在劳动关系的", "trace": {"channel": "none", "n_retrieval_calls": 0}}
